# ===== AI agents =====

# Claude Code (Anthropic). The shared project context (.claude/settings.json,
# skills, hooks, CLAUDE.md) is committed on purpose; only per-machine overrides
# and local state are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE.local.md

